msgid "Prepare a Slurm login node as a workflow host with Python environments, a Prefect login, and IBM Quantum credentials for QRMI"
msgstr "Prepara un nodo di login Slurm come host del workflow con ambienti Python, un login Prefect e credenziali IBM Quantum per QRMI"

