# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up QCSC-Prefect on a Slurm cluster {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"
msgstr "Configura QCSC-Prefect su un cluster Slurm {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide prepares the login node of a Slurm cluster as the workflow host of qcsc-prefect.\n"
"The qcsc-prefect SQD tutorial starts from the result of this guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Questa guida prepara il nodo di login di un cluster Slurm come host del workflow di qcsc-prefect.\n"
"Il tutorial SQD di qcsc-prefect parte dal risultato di questa guida.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you complete this guide, you have the following items:\n"
msgstr "Dopo aver completato questa guida, avrai i seguenti elementi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Where | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login node, the workflow host | Prefect, the qcsc-prefect packages, and the `qcsc-qrmi` command |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Compute nodes, inside Slurm jobs | The QRMI worker: QRMI with its `task_runner` command, and `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | The block that names your IBM Quantum&reg; instance and QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login node and compute nodes | Your IBM Cloud&reg; API key, instances, and backends for QRMI |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Elemento | Dove | Contenuto |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Nodo di login, l'host del workflow | Prefect, i pacchetti qcsc-prefect e il comando `qcsc-qrmi` |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Nodi di calcolo, all'interno dei job Slurm | Il worker QRMI: QRMI con il suo comando `task_runner` e `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | Il blocco che indica la tua istanza IBM Quantum&reg; e la QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Nodo di login e nodi di calcolo | La tua chiave API IBM Cloud&reg;, le istanze e i backend per QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run each command in a terminal on the login node, unless the step says otherwise.\n"
msgstr "Esegui ogni comando in un terminale sul nodo di login, salvo diversa indicazione nel passaggio.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prerequisiti {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A Slurm cluster with OpenMPI, PMIx, and the QRMI SPANK plugin, which the cluster\n"
"administrator installs. The following guides describe these components:\n"
msgstr ""
"Un cluster Slurm con OpenMPI, PMIx e il plugin SPANK di QRMI, che l'amministratore\n"
"del cluster installa. Le guide seguenti descrivono questi componenti:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"
msgstr "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin for QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"
msgstr "[Plugin SPANK per QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin user guide](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"
msgstr "[Guida utente del plugin SPANK](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A home directory and a work directory that the login node and the compute nodes see at\n"
"the same absolute paths\n"
msgstr ""
"Una home directory e una directory di lavoro che il nodo di login e i nodi di calcolo vedono\n"
"agli stessi percorsi assoluti\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS access to GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum, and Prefect Cloud from the login\n"
"node, and to IBM Quantum from the compute nodes\n"
msgstr ""
"Accesso HTTPS in uscita a GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum e Prefect Cloud dal nodo di\n"
"login, e a IBM Quantum dai nodi di calcolo\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum Platform account with an IBM Cloud API key and at least one instance\n"
msgstr "Un account IBM Quantum Platform con una chiave API IBM Cloud e almeno un'istanza\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Prefect Cloud account, or a Prefect server that you host\n"
msgstr "Un account Prefect Cloud, oppure un server Prefect che ospiti tu\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Git, C and C++ compilers, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK, and MPI on the cluster, for the solver\n"
"builds of the tutorial\n"
msgstr ""
"Git, compilatori C e C++, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK e MPI sul cluster, per le build dei solver\n"
"del tutorial\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The examples use the Slurm partition `normal` and the compute nodes `c1` and `c2`. Replace\n"
"them with the names of your cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gli esempi usano la partizione Slurm `normal` e i nodi di calcolo `c1` e `c2`. Sostituiscili\n"
"con i nomi del tuo cluster.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Log in to the login node {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"
msgstr "Passaggio 1: accedi al nodo di login {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Install uv {#step-2-install-uv}"
msgstr "Passaggio 2: installa uv {#step-2-install-uv}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) package manager, and check the installation:\n"
msgstr "Installa il gestore di pacchetti [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) e verifica l'installazione:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Set the paths and create the work directory {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"
msgstr "Passaggio 3: imposta i percorsi e crea la directory di lavoro {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide and the tutorials use two environment variables:\n"
msgstr "Questa guida e i tutorial usano due variabili d'ambiente:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Example | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | The qcsc-prefect checkout |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | The work directory of the solver jobs and the QRMI jobs |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Variabile | Esempio | Scopo |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | Il checkout di qcsc-prefect |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | La directory di lavoro dei job del solver e dei job QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Both paths must be on storage that the compute nodes see at the same absolute path. If\n"
"your cluster has no `/shared` directory, choose another shared path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Entrambi i percorsi devono trovarsi su uno storage che i nodi di calcolo vedono allo stesso percorso assoluto. Se\n"
"il tuo cluster non ha una directory `/shared`, scegli un altro percorso condiviso.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the variables, and create the work directory. Set the variables again in every new\n"
"shell before you follow a tutorial:\n"
msgstr ""
"Imposta le variabili e crea la directory di lavoro. Imposta di nuovo le variabili in ogni nuova\n"
"shell prima di seguire un tutorial:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the variables in every new shell automatically, add them to `~/.bashrc`:\n"
msgstr "Per impostare automaticamente le variabili in ogni nuova shell, aggiungile a `~/.bashrc`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Clone qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"
msgstr "Passaggio 4: clona qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the repository, and check out a release tag, for example `v0.3.1`:\n"
msgstr "Clona il repository e fai il checkout di un tag di release, ad esempio `v0.3.1`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Create the workflow environment {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"
msgstr "Passaggio 5: crea l'ambiente del workflow {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the workflow environment with Python 3.12, and activate it:\n"
msgstr "Crea l'ambiente del workflow con Python 3.12 e attivalo:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the qcsc-prefect packages. The `--no-deps` option keeps the exact version pins\n"
"between the packages of the checkout. The tutorial installs the workflow itself:\n"
msgstr ""
"Installa i pacchetti qcsc-prefect. L'opzione `--no-deps` mantiene le versioni esatte fissate\n"
"tra i pacchetti del checkout. Il tutorial installa il workflow stesso:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the commands are available:\n"
msgstr "Verifica che i comandi siano disponibili:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate `~/venv/qcsc-host` in every new shell on the login node.\n"
msgstr "Attiva `~/venv/qcsc-host` in ogni nuova shell sul nodo di login.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Log in to Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"
msgstr "Passaggio 6: accedi a Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log in to Prefect Cloud. Choose **Paste an API key**, paste a Prefect Cloud API key, and\n"
"choose your workspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Accedi a Prefect Cloud. Scegli **Paste an API key**, incolla una chiave API di Prefect Cloud e\n"
"scegli il tuo workspace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the connection. The output shows `PREFECT_API_URL` and your workspace:\n"
msgstr "Controlla la connessione. L'output mostra `PREFECT_API_URL` e il tuo workspace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Optional: use your own Prefect server\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Facoltativo: usa il tuo server Prefect\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this note if you use Prefect Cloud. To use your own Prefect server instead of Prefect\n"
"Cloud, follow\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"and set the address of your server in place of `<server-host>`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Salta questa nota se usi Prefect Cloud. Per usare il tuo server Prefect al posto di Prefect\n"
"Cloud, segui\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"e imposta l'indirizzo del tuo server al posto di `<server-host>`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Store the IBM Quantum credentials {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"
msgstr "Passo 7: Salva le credenziali IBM Quantum {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run `qcsc-qrmi login` after the Prefect login, because it saves the `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"
msgstr "Esegui `qcsc-qrmi login` dopo il login a Prefect, perché salva il blocco `qrmi-runtime`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Answer the prompts:\n"
msgstr "Rispondi alle richieste:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paste your IBM Cloud API key. The key is not shown.\n"
msgstr "Incolla la tua chiave API di IBM Cloud. La chiave non viene mostrata.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Enter to use all instances.\n"
msgstr "Premi Invio per usare tutte le istanze.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the number of the default instance, `1` in the following example.\n"
msgstr "Inserisci il numero dell'istanza predefinita, `1` nell'esempio seguente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter the number or the name of the default backend, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) in the\n"
"following example.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inserisci il numero o il nome del backend predefinito, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) nell'esempio\n"
"seguente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command also prints a note about the compute nodes and `[qrmi]` lines for\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, which the example omits (`...`). You do not need the `[qrmi]` lines,\n"
"because the workflow reads the instance and the backend from the `qrmi-runtime` block.\n"
msgstr ""
"Il comando stampa anche una nota sui nodi di calcolo e righe `[qrmi]` per\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, che l'esempio omette (`...`). Non ti servono le righe `[qrmi]`,\n"
"perché il workflow legge l'istanza e il backend dal blocco `qrmi-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `qcsc-qrmi` command has the following subcommands:\n"
msgstr "Il comando `qcsc-qrmi` ha i seguenti sottocomandi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Store the API key, the instances, and the backends, and save the block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Find the instances and backends again with the stored key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Print the instances and backends, without the key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Check that the instance of the block can use its backend |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Comando | Scopo |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Salva la chiave API, le istanze e i backend, e salva il blocco |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Trova di nuovo le istanze e i backend con la chiave salvata |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Stampa le istanze e i backend, senza la chiave |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Verifica che l'istanza del blocco possa usare il suo backend |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the file on the compute nodes {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"
msgstr "Installa il file sui nodi di calcolo {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SPANK plugin reads `qrmi_config.json` on each compute node, from the path in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, often `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Ask your cluster administrator to\n"
"install your `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` at that path. Install it again after each\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` or `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Il plugin SPANK legge `qrmi_config.json` su ogni nodo di calcolo, dal percorso indicato in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, spesso `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Chiedi all'amministratore del tuo cluster di\n"
"installare il tuo `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` in quel percorso. Installalo di nuovo dopo ogni\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` o `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep **Session Mode** of the `qrmi-runtime` block at `batch`, because the SPANK plugin\n"
"acquires the QPU in batch mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mantieni **Session Mode** del blocco `qrmi-runtime` su `batch`, perché il plugin SPANK\n"
"acquisisce la QPU in batch mode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Create the compute-node environment {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"
msgstr "Passo 8: Crea l'ambiente dei nodi di calcolo {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI worker runs on a compute node, in its own environment. Create it from the same\n"
"checkout. The `--python` option keeps `~/venv/qcsc-host` active:\n"
msgstr ""
"Il worker QRMI viene eseguito su un nodo di calcolo, nel suo ambiente. Crealo dallo stesso\n"
"checkout. L'opzione `--python` mantiene attivo `~/venv/qcsc-host`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qrmi[ibm]` package provides the `task_runner` command. The tutorial adds the SQD\n"
"compilation hook to this environment, and uses `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` as the\n"
"`python_executable` of `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Il pacchetto `qrmi[ibm]` fornisce il comando `task_runner`. Il tutorial aggiunge a questo ambiente l'hook di\n"
"compilazione SQD e usa `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` come\n"
"`python_executable` di `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Verify the setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"
msgstr "Passo 9: Verifica la configurazione {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the `qrmi-runtime` block exists:\n"
msgstr "Verifica che il blocco `qrmi-runtime` esista:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the stored instances and backends. The command never prints the key:\n"
msgstr "Controlla le istanze e i backend salvati. Il comando non stampa mai la chiave:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the default instance can use the default backend:\n"
msgstr "Verifica che l'istanza predefinita possa usare il backend predefinito:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that Slurm runs a job on both compute nodes, also with PMIx:\n"
msgstr "Verifica che Slurm esegua un job su entrambi i nodi di calcolo, anche con PMIx:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check the compute-node environment and the work directory on a compute node. The first\n"
"command prints nothing when the imports succeed:\n"
msgstr ""
"Controlla l'ambiente dei nodi di calcolo e la directory di lavoro su un nodo di calcolo. Il primo\n"
"comando non stampa nulla se gli import vanno a buon fine:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Prossimi passi {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Raccomandazioni\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"to choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Leggi [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"per scegliere i nodi, i rank e i thread dei job del solver.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the [SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
"for the configuration file, the solvers, and the run parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"Leggi il [README del workflow SQD](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
"per il file di configurazione, i solver e i parametri di esecuzione.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
